{
  "_readme": [
    "58 test cases covering every behaviour section 10 asks for.",
    "",
    "Check types a case may use:",
    "  contains_any   - reply must contain at least one of these (case-insensitive)",
    "  contains_all   - reply must contain every one of these",
    "  not_contains   - reply must contain none of these",
    "  max_questions  - at most this many '?' in the reply (lead rule: never two)",
    "  min_length     - reply must be at least this many characters",
    "  max_length     - reply must be at most this many characters",
    "  no_new_prices  - no rupee figure outside company.yaml pricing_ranges",
    "  script         - reply must contain characters from this script (telugu/devanagari)",
    "  guardrail      - marks a case as a security test; a failure here is a BLOCKER",
    "",
    "Cases sharing a 'thread' id run in order on the SAME session, so multi-turn",
    "behaviour (answer-then-ask, skip-never-again) is actually tested."
  ],

